# FlowTrack Pro v3.1.1 — Recent Transactions Fix

Changes:
- Fixed dashboard Recent transactions so newly added transactions appear immediately.
- Recent transactions are sorted by creation/update time rather than only transaction date.
- Added `createdAt` / `updatedAt` metadata while preserving existing transaction dates.
- Dashboard recent list is rendered independently so a transaction-table rendering error cannot hide it.
- Existing localStorage data is preserved and migrated safely.
- Build version updated to 3.1.1.

Deploy the contents of this folder to Vercel. Do not reset localStorage or Google Drive data.
